---
title: Without an index
order: 1
---
<norn-search @site="example.com" :@bundle="url('/assets/no-index.js')"></norn-search>
<p>The preview builds no Pagefind index, so this is the plain form: it searches example.com on the web. The story points <code>@bundle</code> at a script that fails to load, where a site passes Pagefind's own. With an index, results list under the field as you type.</p>
